      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、それでいい。\r\nこの世には知らない方がよいこともある。",
        "official_en": "But consider yourself fortunate. Some things in this world are better left unknown.",
        "real_en": "But that’s fine. Some things in this world are better left unknown."
      },
