      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "できるわ！\r\nアタシはシドの名前を継ぐ者なんだから！",
        "official_en": "Well prepare to eat your own words! I’ll have you know <text style=\"italic\">I</> intend to inherit the name of Cid someday!",
        "real_en": "I can! I’m the one who’ll carry on the name of Cid!"
