      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "インビンシブルを復活させて、\r\nどうしようっていうの？",
        "official_en": "Even if you can get it to work, what do you even intend to do with the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>?",
        "real_en": "What do you plan to do once you revive the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>?"
