        "official_en_sha256": "9291c552eb454d019c9d59d66a126f96615bad69d3ef4513bfb7bf7029388078"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何も知らずに死んでいった方が\r\nお前たちにとっては幸せだ。",
        "official_en": "Ignorance is bliss, as one says...and your deaths shall ensure that.",
        "real_en": "It would be better for you to die without ever knowing."
